{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08809","headline":"鲁东门观刈蒲 · 李白","name":"鲁东门观刈蒲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鲁国寒事早，初霜刈渚蒲。\n挥镰若转月，拂水生连珠。\n此草最可珍，何必贵龙须。\n织作玉牀席，欣承清夜娱。\n罗衣能再拂，不畏素尘芜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08809.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08809","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}